Synlabs is an applied AI and machine learning engineering company. 
They build cost-efficient RAG applications, LLM evaluation pipelines, and vector store architectures. 
The office internship requires candidates to complete a take-home assignment focusing on RAG optimization and LLM-as-judge bias mitigation within one day. 
